OL,3,GNEWSAGroup of meerkats die after tunnel
OL,4,Acollapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mob of meerkats have died after a
OL,7,Fnetwork of their tunnels collapsed
OL,8,Fduring "sudden heavy rain".
OL,10,FTropical Birdland in Desford,
OL,11,FLeicestershire, confirmed on Monday one
OL,12,Fmeerkat was rescued, but staff
OL,13,Fdiscovered the rest of the mob had died
OL,14,Fas a result of the collapse.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the wildlife
OL,17,Fattraction said the meerkats had been
OL,18,Fdigging out a fresh underground
OL,19,Fchamber, as the matriarch, named Big
OL,20,FMama, was expecting her next litter.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
